   "title": "READ ME FIRST",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Quality Mode Switch \u2014 draft/final in one toggle\n\n**Setup (2 clicks):** pick a checkpoint on *Load Checkpoint* and a\nspeed-up LoRA (lightning / lightx2v / turbo) on *LoRA (draft only)*.\n\nThe **mode** toggle on Quality Mode Switch is the only thing you touch\nafterwards:\n- **draft** (off): LoRA-patched model, 4 steps, cfg 1.0 \u2014 fast preview.\n- **final** (on): clean model straight from the checkpoint, 30 steps,\n  cfg 3.5 \u2014 the LoRA loader is *bypassed entirely* (never even loads).\n\nsteps + cfg feed the KSampler, so flipping the toggle reconfigures the\nwhole run. fps/frames outputs are for video workflows \u2014 wire them into\nyour video-combine / length nodes (previews show their values here).\nThe terminal logs which profile ran and every value it emitted.\n\nErrors are self-explanatory: e.g. flipping to final without a\nfinal_model connection tells you exactly which wire is missing."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Quality Mode Switch \u2014 draft/final in one toggle\n\n**Setup (2 clicks):** pick a checkpoint on *Load Checkpoint* and a\nspeed-up LoRA (lightning / lightx2v / turbo) on *LoRA (draft only)*.\n\nThe **mode** toggle on Quality Mode Switch is the only thing you touch\nafterwards:\n- **draft** (off): LoRA-patched model, 4 steps, cfg 1.0 \u2014 fast preview.\n- **final** (on): clean model straight from the checkpoint, 30 steps,\n  cfg 3.5 \u2014 the LoRA loader is *bypassed entirely* (never even loads).\n\nsteps + cfg feed the KSampler, so flipping the toggle reconfigures the\nwhole run. fps/frames outputs are for video workflows \u2014 wire them into\nyour video-combine / length nodes (previews show their values here).\nThe terminal logs which profile ran and every value it emitted.\n\nErrors are self-explanatory: e.g. flipping to final without a\nfinal_model connection tells you exactly which wire is missing."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
